WEBVTT

00:13:28.095 --> 00:13:31.139
I think you will have
a lot of joy and satisfaction in it,

00:13:31.181 --> 00:13:32.641
like I've found.

00:13:33.475 --> 00:13:35.269
We don't actually risk anything,

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:38.647
because all we risk losing is our pain.

00:13:39.606 --> 00:13:43.735
And then you'll learn
the most powerful lesson I've learned

00:13:43.777 --> 00:13:47.531
from five decades of being
a social justice activist:

00:13:48.448 --> 00:13:51.201
fighting hate should be fun.

00:13:51.243 --> 00:13:52.327
(Laughter)

00:13:52.327 --> 00:13:55.080
It's being a hater that sucks.

00:13:55.122 --> 00:13:56.456
Thank y'all.

00:13:56.456 --> 00:14:00.419
(Applause and cheers)